# Binary artifacts not version-controlled going forward.
# (Existing tracked .docx/.pptx deliverables stay tracked; these only block NEW additions.
#  Large tracked .zip/.npz are removed from the tree in Phase 3 and purged from history in Phase 6.)
*.zip
*.npz
*.docx
*.pptx
